        543.0908203125,
        388.3279113769531
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "tiable resampling within the SMC framework. While empiri-",
      "bbox": [
        307.44000244140625,
        391.3763732910156,
        543.0980224609375,
        400.2829284667969
